    "reason": "[ev-ddf5fd344d03] only says Cilium's support for Consul has been removed. An environment is exposed only if Cilium itself is set up to use Consul, not just because some Consul version exists in the inventory. The proposed product-version{consul, >=1.0.0} condition is therefore too broad: it flags clusters that run Consul for unrelated purposes. Neither the cited line nor the 1.17 Upgrade Notes section names the flag, Helm value or option that points Cilium at Consul, so no correct predicate follows from the evidence.",
